# a missing option argument in a command
program Commands
arg add
arg --name
status 1
output
Error: Argument required for option --name
add [options] items...  Add items.

  -n <arg>, --name <arg>
      Call callback on name argument.

commands [options] [command [options]] arguments...

  -h, --help
      Display help message and exit.
  -v, --verbose
      Call callback for verbose.

add [options] items...  Add items.

  -n <arg>, --name <arg>
      Call callback on name argument.

list [options] patterns...  List items.

  -c <arg>, --count <arg>
      Call callback on count argument.
Terminated by Halt(1). 
